# v24.4.0-Beal-44-13-Level-26-v24x-Final-Summary: honest v24.x final summary (not v25); matveev_v24x_summary (|Lambda| = log(1+B^4/A^4) <= B^4/A^4 = B^4/((B+3)^13-B^4) and 0 < exp(C) < 1e-12 < 1 with C = -height_B0 log height_B0, height_B0 = 104382751019310000000 = C1_floor*30^6, 30^6=729000000) / matveev_v24x_conditional_summary (IF target THEN 0 < exp(C) < B^4/A^4 and B^4*(1+exp(C)) > exp(C)*(B+3)^13) / bugeaud_v24x_final_link / baker_v24x_reduction_shape; target, baker_bound_gap3, and bugeaud_LLL_reduction_conditional stay def Prop; locked Lean 0 vs v24.3.2 305e5f4 except BealMatveevThm14.lean, RibetMazur.lean, and BealBakerB0ReductionCertificate.lean summary shape. Previous v24.3.2 DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22732045. Series concept 10.5281/zenodo.22379293.
# v24.3.2-Beal-44-13-Level-26-Exp-Numerical-Bound: numerical tiny bound exp(C) << 10^{-12} toward B0; height_B0 > 10^20 / log height_B0 > 46 via 2^83 < 10^25 so log 10 > 2.3 / C_exp_bound <= -10^12 / 0 < exp(C) < exp(-10^12) < 10^{-12} < 1 (matveev_C_exp_bound_le_neg_1e12 / matveev_target_exp_lower_lt_exp_neg_1e12 / matveev_target_exp_lower_lt_onee12 / matveev_exp_C_pos_lt_one); target, baker_bound_gap3, and bugeaud_LLL_reduction_conditional stay def Prop; locked Lean 0 vs v24.3.1 d189ef9 except BealMatveevThm14.lean and RibetMazur.lean. Previous v24.3.1 DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22731966. Current v24.3.2 DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22732045. Series concept 10.5281/zenodo.22379293.
# v24.3.1-Beal-44-13-Level-26-Conditional-B-Lower: derive explicit B lower bound from conditional Matveev ratio bound; matveev_gap3_A_pow_eq_B3_pow_sub_B_pow (A^4 = (B+3)^13 - B^4) / matveev_gap3_ratio_explicit (B^4 / A^4 = B^4 / ((B+3)^13 - B^4)) / matveev_gap3_conditional_B_lower (IF |Lambda| > exp(C_exp_bound) THEN B^4 / ((B+3)^13 - B^4) > exp(C_exp_bound) and B^4 * (1 + exp(C_exp_bound)) > exp(C_exp_bound) * (B+3)^13) / matveev_gap3_conditional_B_lower_of_target / matveev_gap3_conditional_B_pos_lower; target, baker_bound_gap3, and bugeaud_LLL_reduction_conditional stay def Prop; locked Lean 0 vs v24.3.0 6a0a0b1 except BealMatveevThm14.lean and RibetMazur.lean. Previous v24.3.0 DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22731759. Current v24.3.1 DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22731966. Series concept 10.5281/zenodo.22379293.
# v24.3.0-Beal-44-13-Level-26-Bugeaud-LLL-Link: link conditional Matveev ratio bound to Baker B0=1e6 certificate and LLL reduction; matveev_gap3_conditional_ratio_pos (0 < exp(C_exp_bound) < B^4/A^4) / matveev_gap3_ratio_pos_of_conditional_lower / bugeaud_LLL_reduction_conditional (matveev_inequality_real_formal -> ∃ B_reduced <= 1e6, ∀ solution with B <= 1e6, B <= B_reduced); target and baker_bound_gap3 stay def Prop; locked Lean 0 vs v24.2.3 ed94732 except BealMatveevThm14.lean, BealBugeaudLLLFormal.lean, and RibetMazur.lean. Previous v24.2.3 DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22731634. Current v24.3.0 DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22731759. Series concept 10.5281/zenodo.22379293.
# v24.2.3-Beal-44-13-Level-26-Matveev-Conditional-Lower: conditional lower bound implies ratio bound on gap-3 solutions; matveev_conditional_lower_implies_ratio_gt_exp (|Lambda| > target -> B^4/A^4 > target) / matveev_conditional_lower_implies_ratio_gt_exp_of_solution / matveev_gap3_ratio_lower_bound_conditional (solution ∧ matveev_inequality_real_target -> B^4/A^4 > exp(C_exp_bound)); target and baker_bound_gap3 stay def Prop; locked Lean 0 vs v24.2.2 ffd8343 except BealMatveevThm14.lean and RibetMazur.lean. Previous v24.2.2 DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22731508. Current v24.2.3 DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22731634. Series concept 10.5281/zenodo.22379293.
